<noinclude>
Displays the shop inventory table for a merchant.
If placed on a specific NPC instance (e.g. [[Nayla]]), it automatically resolves the base definition (e.g. [[Desert Crafting Merchant]]) and queries Cargo for the stock.
Usage:
  {{ShopStock}}
  {{ShopStock|shop=Desert Crafting Merchant}}
</noinclude><includeonly>
{{#cargo_query:
tables=ShopInventory
|fields=Item,Price,Stock
|where=Shop="{{{1|{{{shop|{{#invoke:NPCData|getBaseDef}}}}}}}}"
|format=table
|headers=Item,Price,Stock
|default=This merchant's stock has not been cataloged yet.
}}
</includeonly>
